        "final_response": "Implemented the financial API across the existing services. Market-service serves the five fixed quotes; user-service owns users, cash, positions, and portfolio totals; trade-service coordinates buys and sells, stores history in its own database, and publishes completed-trade audit events. The gateway routes the public paths to those services. Rejected trades leave cash and positions unchanged and create no trade record.\n\nI validated the Maven POMs and service YAML files. I could not run a build because Maven is not installed in the workspace; the orchestrator still needs to build and run the external acceptance suite.",
